{"version":2,"slug":"5-english-words-with-multiple-meanings-learn-english-in-context","videoId":"Pv_oW7wbgOU","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/Pv_oW7wbgOU","lang":"en","title":"5 English Words With Multiple Meanings | Learn English in Context","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"You know this English word."},{"start":4,"text":"But do you know all of its meanings?"},{"start":10,"text":"If you don't,"},{"start":13,"text":"you will"},{"start":14,"text":"by the end of this video. I run in the"},{"start":19,"text":"mornings."},{"start":20,"text":"But, I also run a business."},{"start":25,"text":"I just arrived home."},{"start":28,"text":"And I just went to the gym"},{"start":33,"text":"for 30 minutes."},{"start":35,"text":"Just 30 minutes."},{"start":37,"text":"It sounds so difficult"},{"start":40,"text":"to memorize all the definitions"},{"start":44,"text":"that one word has. But,"},{"start":47,"text":"it's actually easier"},{"start":50,"text":"than you'd think because you [music]"},{"start":53,"text":"don't need to memorize a long list of"},{"start":58,"text":"definitions. You can learn them"},{"start":62,"text":"in context."},{"start":64,"text":"And that's what we're going to do today."},{"start":70,"text":"This morning,"},{"start":71,"text":"I just wanted"},{"start":74,"text":"to sleep."},{"start":76,"text":"I"},{"start":77,"text":"was so"},{"start":79,"text":"tired."},{"start":81,"text":"But suddenly,"},{"start":84,"text":"I got a phone call."},{"start":87,"text":"It was my co-worker."},{"start":90,"text":"I looked"},{"start":92,"text":"at the time"},{"start":93,"text":"and realized I"},{"start":96,"text":"was late."},{"start":98,"text":"Very late."},{"start":101,"text":"I got dressed"},{"start":104,"text":"really fast."},{"start":106,"text":"I grabbed my bag and I ran outside."},{"start":111,"text":"Normally, I take a bus"},{"start":114,"text":"to work."},{"start":116,"text":"But, when I got to the bus stop,"},{"start":121,"text":"the bus was already leaving."},{"start":125,"text":"I missed it."},{"start":127,"text":"I thought, \"Great."},{"start":130,"text":"I just missed the bus."},{"start":134,"text":"I just missed it."},{"start":137,"text":"And I was already late."},{"start":140,"text":"So, I decided to take an Uber"},{"start":144,"text":"instead."},{"start":145,"text":"The Uber took about 20 minutes to get to"},{"start":151,"text":"my office."},{"start":153,"text":"And during the ride,"},{"start":156,"text":"I got another phone call."},{"start":159,"text":"This time,"},{"start":160,"text":"it was my mom. I answered and said,"},{"start":165,"text":"\"Mom, I'm sorry."},{"start":167,"text":"I can't talk right now."},{"start":170,"text":"I'm running late.\" She said,"},{"start":173,"text":"\"Okay, okay."},{"start":175,"text":"No worries."},{"start":176,"text":"I just wanted to ask you something.\""},{"start":180,"text":"And she hung up."},{"start":182,"text":"When I finally got to work,"},{"start":186,"text":"my coworker saw me"},{"start":189,"text":"and said, \"Where were you?"},{"start":193,"text":"I just called you.\""},{"start":196,"text":"I said,"},{"start":197,"text":"\"I know, I know."},{"start":200,"text":"I missed the bus.\""},{"start":203,"text":"She laughed and said,"},{"start":205,"text":"\"Well,"},{"start":207,"text":"at least you're here now. It's okay.\""},{"start":210,"text":"And she was right."},{"start":213,"text":"So, I sat down and started working."},{"start":217,"text":"A few hours later,"},{"start":221,"text":"I got hungry."},{"start":224,"text":"So,"},{"start":225,"text":"I decided to take a break."},{"start":229,"text":"I normally take a break around"},{"start":229.6,"text":"or"},{"start":230.2,"text":"p.m."},{"start":236,"text":"It was a little early to take a break,"},{"start":241,"text":"but"},{"start":242,"text":"I was starving."},{"start":244,"text":"I didn't have any breakfast."},{"start":250,"text":"I just needed something small to eat."},{"start":256,"text":"So,"},{"start":257,"text":"I went next door"},{"start":260,"text":"to a cafe"},{"start":262,"text":"near my office."},{"start":265,"text":"I ordered a coffee"},{"start":268,"text":"and a sandwich,"},{"start":270,"text":"and the cashier, \"ching ching\","},{"start":273,"text":"said,"},{"start":274,"text":"\"Your sandwich"},{"start":277,"text":"will take about"},{"start":280,"text":"10 minutes.\""},{"start":282,"text":"10 minutes?"},{"start":285,"text":"I thought"},{"start":286,"text":"it would take two."},{"start":288,"text":"But, that was fine."},{"start":291,"text":"I sat down"},{"start":292,"text":"and called my mom back."},{"start":295,"text":"She answered and said,"},{"start":298,"text":"\"I was just about to call you.\""},{"start":302,"text":"We talked for a few minutes."},{"start":306,"text":"I got my sandwich"},{"start":308,"text":"and I drank my coffee."},{"start":311,"text":"And then, I went back to work."},{"start":315,"text":"And luckily,"},{"start":316,"text":"the rest of my day"},{"start":319,"text":"was less chaotic."},{"start":321,"text":"Like this video if you want more English"},{"start":324,"text":"practice with these words in context."},{"start":328,"text":"Great."},{"start":329,"text":"Now,"},{"start":330,"text":"you probably know all of the words that"},{"start":334,"text":"I just used. Just, get, run, take, miss,"},{"start":340,"text":"and write."},{"start":341,"text":"But, did you notice that they didn't"},{"start":344,"text":"always mean"},{"start":346,"text":"what you thought they meant."},{"start":349,"text":"Just."},{"start":351,"text":"At the beginning, I said,"},{"start":354,"text":"\"I just wanted to sleep.\""},{"start":357,"text":"In this case, just means only."},{"start":361,"text":"I only wanted to sleep."},{"start":364,"text":"But then I said,"},{"start":366,"text":"\"I just missed the bus.\""},{"start":369,"text":"In this case, it means a short time ago"},{"start":373,"text":"or"},{"start":374,"text":"recently."},{"start":376,"text":"I recently missed the bus or"},{"start":379,"text":"\"I just missed the bus"},{"start":382,"text":"right before it left.\""},{"start":384,"text":"And then my coworker said,"},{"start":386,"text":"\"I just called you.\""},{"start":389,"text":"The same."},{"start":391,"text":"She called me very recently."},{"start":394,"text":"Just a little bit ago."},{"start":397,"text":"So,"},{"start":398,"text":"\"I just want coffee.\""},{"start":400,"text":"I only want coffee."},{"start":403,"text":"\"I just made coffee.\""},{"start":406,"text":"I recently made coffee."},{"start":408,"text":"Same word,"},{"start":410,"text":"different meaning."},{"start":411,"text":"Now, with get,"},{"start":413,"text":"I said, \"I got a phone call.\""},{"start":416,"text":"So, I received a phone call"},{"start":419,"text":"in this context. But then I said,"},{"start":422,"text":"\"I got dressed.\""},{"start":424,"text":"In this case,"},{"start":426,"text":"I put my clothes on."},{"start":428,"text":"That's what got dressed means."},{"start":431,"text":"And later I said,"},{"start":432,"text":"\"I got hungry.\""},{"start":434,"text":"In this case, it means to become."},{"start":437,"text":"I became hungry."},{"start":439,"text":"So, listen to these."},{"start":441,"text":"\"I got an email.\""},{"start":443,"text":"I received an email. \"I got home at"},{"start":480,"text":".\""},{"start":480.6,"text":"I arrived home at"},{"start":481.2,"text":". \"I'm getting"},{"start":481.8,"text":"tired.\""},{"start":482.4,"text":"I'm becoming tired."},{"start":483,"text":"That's why you hear get"},{"start":483.6,"text":"in everything in English. Next, we have"},{"start":484.2,"text":"take."},{"start":484.8,"text":"\"I take the bus to work. Here, take"},{"start":485.4,"text":"means you use the bus for"},{"start":486,"text":"transportation. But then I said, \"The"},{"start":486.6,"text":"Uber took 20 minutes.\""},{"start":487.2,"text":"That's the amount of time that it"},{"start":487.8,"text":"required. And then I said, \"I decided to"},{"start":488.4,"text":"take a break.\""},{"start":489,"text":"And this is part of the expression to"},{"start":489.6,"text":"take a break."},{"start":490.2,"text":"So, I took the train"},{"start":490.8,"text":"for transportation."},{"start":491,"text":"It took 3 hours for time, and I'm going"},{"start":495,"text":"to take a break"},{"start":497,"text":"for rest."},{"start":498,"text":"And now, run. You heard this one at the"},{"start":501,"text":"beginning. I run in the mornings."},{"start":505,"text":"I physically run."},{"start":508,"text":"But I run a business."},{"start":511,"text":"I manage a business."},{"start":514,"text":"And then in the story I said, \"I'm"},{"start":516,"text":"running late.\""},{"start":518,"text":"Does that mean I'm physically running"},{"start":522,"text":"late?"},{"start":523,"text":"Running late means I'm behind schedule."},{"start":527,"text":"I'm running late."},{"start":529,"text":"And finally, miss."},{"start":532,"text":"I missed the bus. The bus left without"},{"start":536,"text":"me."},{"start":537,"text":"But then if I say, \"I miss my family.\""},{"start":542,"text":"Then that's the feeling"},{"start":544,"text":"of wanting to be close to my family,"},{"start":547,"text":"of not seeing them."},{"start":549,"text":"And then last one, I missed your call."},{"start":553,"text":"You called me, but I didn't answer."},{"start":556,"text":"So, you can miss a person, you can miss"},{"start":560,"text":"a bus, or you can miss a phone call."},{"start":563,"text":"And this is why I don't want you to"},{"start":566,"text":"panic"},{"start":567,"text":"when you see a word used in a completely"},{"start":571,"text":"different way."},{"start":573,"text":"You might think, \"Wait, I know this"},{"start":576,"text":"word."},{"start":577,"text":"But why is it used in a completely"},{"start":579,"text":"different context here?"},{"start":582,"text":"Like this video if you want more English"},{"start":584,"text":"practice with these words in context."},{"start":588,"text":"And some more good news,"},{"start":592,"text":"you don't have to sit down and memorize"},{"start":595,"text":"every possible definition"},{"start":598,"text":"to every word in English."},{"start":601,"text":"But the more you listen,"},{"start":603,"text":"the more you read,"},{"start":605,"text":"the more you hear these words used in"},{"start":609,"text":"real life situations,"},{"start":611,"text":"the more natural these definitions will"},{"start":614,"text":"start to feel."},{"start":616,"text":"Just think about the story that you just"},{"start":619,"text":"heard."},{"start":620,"text":"You understood what was happening. And"},{"start":623,"text":"because you understood the story,"},{"start":627,"text":"you were able to understand"},{"start":629,"text":"the definition"},{"start":631,"text":"based on the context, right?"},{"start":634,"text":"That's how I want you to learn English."},{"start":638,"text":"Not by memorizing definitions, but by"},{"start":641,"text":"actually experiencing"},{"start":644,"text":"the language."},{"start":645,"text":"So now, I have a little challenge for"},{"start":648,"text":"you."},{"start":649,"text":"What does just mean in this context?"},{"start":653,"text":"I just finished the video."},{"start":658,"text":"Is it recently or only?"},{"start":661,"text":"What about this one?"},{"start":663,"text":"I just want to learn English."},{"start":666,"text":"Recently or only?"},{"start":668,"text":"Tell me in the comments. I won't give"},{"start":670,"text":"you the answer."},{"start":671,"text":"I got really tired after work."},{"start":676,"text":"Now, what does miss mean in this"},{"start":678,"text":"sentence?"},{"start":680,"text":"I missed your call this morning."},{"start":684,"text":"Now, what does run mean in this"},{"start":686,"text":"sentence?"},{"start":688,"text":"I'm sorry, I'm running late."},{"start":693,"text":"And now, what does take mean in this"},{"start":695,"text":"sentence?"},{"start":697,"text":"It took me 4 hours to finish."},{"start":704,"text":"And if you want more videos where we"},{"start":706,"text":"learn English through real stories,"},{"start":710,"text":"then subscribe for more."},{"start":712,"text":"Like this video and keep learning with"},{"start":716,"text":"me."},{"start":717,"text":"I'll see you guys next week."},{"start":719,"text":"Never stop learning."},{"start":722,"text":"Bye."}]}